meta {
  name: 01-day1-browse-anonymously
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/listings?page=0&size=10
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.content: isDefined
  res.body.page: isDefined
}

docs {
  # Day 1, 9:42pm — Lagos

  My husband swears this platform is different. I've heard that before.
  I open it on my phone in airplane mode'd skepticism — no account, no
  email, nothing they can hook me with. Just looking.

  What I want to see on the listing card before I'd ever click in:
  - A verified-property badge
  - The agent's name and rating
  - A real Lagos address
  - A price that isn't suspiciously cheap

  I also want to confirm THE PLATFORM ITSELF doesn't ask me for a fee
  to browse. The previous platforms didn't either, of course — that
  comes later, off-platform. But I'm watching.
}
